Package: mibuds-linux
Version: 1.0.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1, bluez
Maintainer: oh_zhou <oh_zhou@localhost>
Description: Xiaomi/Redmi earbuds battery and ANC controller for Linux
 StatusNotifier tray app showing left/right/case battery and switching
 noise-cancelling modes (ANC / transparency / off) on Xiaomi and Redmi
 earbuds over Bluetooth RFCOMM (RCSP protocol).
 .
 Ported from the Windows MiBudsController project.
